# Milestone: M5
# Covers: e.syncEmit(p) — synchronous event emit; all subscribers run inline
#         before syncEmit returns; spec #3 §6.2 AT_EVENT_SYNC watcher mode.
#
# blocked: Event.syncEmit() method not yet bound on Event stdlib type (audit Cat. E)
# matrix-row: reactive-event
#
# Reason:
#   syncEmit() is a method on Event objects; requires T59 stdlib binding.
#   AT_EVENT_SYNC mode (OP_AT_EVENT_SYNC_INSTALL) is wired in the VM but
#   invoke_body_inline is a stub at M5-stub phase.  The synchronous inline
#   dispatch path (no coroutine spawn) is exercised by test_event_emit_sync.c
#   via the test_watcher_fire_hook.
#
# Activate when Event.new() + syncEmit method + inline body dispatch wired.
#
# Urbiscript source (activate at T59 + M5-scratch-frame):
#   var e = Event.new();
#   var order = "";
#   at (e?) Realm.order = Realm.order + "async";
#   e.syncEmit(1) | order
#   --- expected output ---
#   [00000000] nil
#   [00000001] ""
#   [00000002] nil
#   [00000003] "async"
